==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields and Area Attackers to ward off the Dark horde and you should win. If you can beat Le'Grim's stages, you can do this very easily.

